<description>&lt;p&gt;US forces have begun a land operation against cartels inside Ecuador while President Noboa asked the United States for $430.5 billion in security aid and met with Pete Hegseth on anti-narco cooperation. Noboa rejected claims that former vice president Jorge Glas was tortured, saying his injuries were self-inflicted. Journalist Omar Toledo was shot by motorcycle gunmen and wounded. Fugitive gang boss Commander Willy was arrested at a hotel in Sitges and deported from Spain. The UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNTHRGeEMzS3l0cG9lTGFMUDRnVzVLb1dqU1RYRlVlR29BbWFGNHI4bjNCOGJuRjhCNVFCQkQ1ZUdORTlBN1A2QVF3aUxXWERlem02SlJIYUkxOU81Q1NYVWx0MUViUFR6Qk5ETlZWUDNNU01wcFJHbVREY0JnaDlMT1RPZk11UmFNMGNVMjNKYmpEVWxEOHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQaV9Bc2dRS2ZUXzRyLXNEcjEza0wzQm5Gc2tTa3JwcW1mdjZEcWw0dVNQb1NIUE56Z19LWVZ0WWJ0MkZDQXhSUGlCcVFrRThzVlJnVmhlMS1lcEkxZFBjaldLWHZaZ0dJMVhTWGtpWnNjOF9Nc18tZFk5UzNweUttRk1hcjhiZndpRnFUQ2gyTU41b3EyNFZ2SmpHZkpGNEp6R2NpNC0yT0xDTEZzRnJJanB0WXN1bG8?oc=5&quot;&gt;WV News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQRm1HTndRU0h4UWEwVG9RVlRndnBrRTh3X2RzbTZ4THZ1UEI0aS1vMExXR2IxRG41RlczbmpwRzlUaUpjRUpVa3pSR2JaZldXMTVXUldwbmxFa1RkQmF5SVlZcmhycGZqRU0xakpFR1FfWWR1aFBaYVZGNUlLNW1UcnBucEFPa1E0YUdscjVKUFM5ZkJSRXdNUnFzU2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsCord&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;European External Action Service (EEAS)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNUV92RTJMbFE4RDdQbH